tta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja484:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja484:0.2": "Pakiṇṇakanipāta ", "ja484:0.3": "Sālikedāravagga ", "ja484:0.4": "1. Sālikedārajātaka ", "ja484:1.1": "“Sampannaṁ sālikedāraṁ, ", "ja484:1.2": "suvā bhuñjanti kosiya; ", "ja484:1.3": "Paṭivedemi te brahme, ", "ja484:1.4": "na ne vāretumussahe. ", "ja484:2.1": "Eko ca tattha sakuṇo, ", "ja484:2.2": "yo nesaṁ sabbasundaro; ", "ja484:2.3": "Bhutvā sāliṁ yathākāmaṁ, ", "ja484:2.4": "tuṇḍenādāya gacchati”. ", "ja484:3.1": "“Oḍḍentu vāḷapāsāni, ", "ja484:3.2": "yathā bajjhetha so dijo; ", "ja484:3.3": "Jīvañca naṁ gahetvāna, ", "ja484:3.4": "ānayehi mamantike”. ", "ja484:4.1": "“Ete bhutvā pivitvā ca, ", "ja484:4.2": "pakkamanti vihaṅgamā; ", "ja484:4.3": "Eko baddhosmi pāsena, ", "ja484:4.4": "kiṁ pāpaṁ pakataṁ mayā”. ", "ja484:5.1": "“Udaraṁ nūna aññesaṁ, ", "ja484:5.2": "suva accodaraṁ tava; ", "ja484:5.3": "Bhutvā sāliṁ yathākāmaṁ, ", "ja484:5.4": "tuṇḍenādāya gacchasi. ", "ja484:6.1": "Koṭṭhaṁ nu tattha pūresi, ", "ja484:6.2": "suva veraṁ nu te mayā; ", "ja484:6.3": "Puṭṭho me samma akkhāhi, ", "ja484:6.4": "kuhiṁ sāliṁ nidāhasi”. ", "ja484:7.1": "“Na me veraṁ tayā saddhiṁ, ", "ja484:7.2": "koṭṭho mayhaṁ na vijjati; ", "ja484:7.3": "Iṇaṁ muñcāmiṇaṁ dammi, ", "ja484:7.4": "sampatto koṭasimbaliṁ; ", "ja484:7.5": "Nidhimpi tattha nidahāmi, ", "ja484:7.6": "evaṁ jānāhi kosiya”. ", "ja484:8.1": "“Kīdisaṁ te iṇadānaṁ, ", "ja484:8.2": "iṇamokkho ca kīdiso; ", "ja484:8.3": "Nidhinidhānamakkhāhi, ", "ja484:8.4": "atha pāsā pamokkhasi”. ", "ja484:9.1": "“Ajātapakkhā taruṇā, ", "ja484:9.2": "puttakā mayha kosiya; ", "ja484:9.3": "Te maṁ bhatā bharissanti, ", "ja484:9.4": "tasmā tesaṁ iṇaṁ dade. ", "ja484:10.1": "Mātā pitā ca me vuddhā, ", "ja484:10.2": "jiṇṇakā gatayobbanā; ", "ja484:10.3": "Tesaṁ tuṇḍena hātūna, ", "ja484:10.4": "muñce pubbakataṁ iṇaṁ. ", "ja484:11.1": "Aññepi tattha sakuṇā, ", "ja484:11.2": "khīṇapakkhā sudubbalā; ", "ja484:11.3": "Tesaṁ puññatthiko dammi, ", "ja484:11.4": "taṁ nidhiṁ āhu paṇḍitā. ", "ja484:12.1": "Īdisaṁ me iṇadānaṁ, ", "ja484:12.2": "iṇamokkho ca īdiso; ", "ja484:12.3": "Nidhinidhānamakkhāmi, ", "ja484:12.4": "evaṁ jānāhi kosiya”. ", "ja484:13.1": "“Bhaddako vatayaṁ pakkhī, ", "ja484:13.2": "dijo paramadhammiko; ", "ja484:13.3": "Ekaccesu manussesu, ", "ja484:13.4": "ayaṁ dhammo na vijjati. ", "ja484:14.1": "Bhuñja sāliṁ yathākāmaṁ, ", "ja484:14.2": "saha sabbehi ñātibhi; ", "ja484:14.3": "Punāpi suva passemu, ", "ja484:14.4": "piyaṁ me tava dassanaṁ”. ", "ja484:15.1": "“Bhuttañca pītañca tavassamamhi, ", "ja484:15.2": "Ratī ca no kosiya te sakāse; ", "ja484:15.3": "Nikkhittadaṇḍesu dadāhi dānaṁ, ", "ja484:15.4": "Jiṇṇe ca mātāpitaro bharassu”. ", "ja484:16.1": "“Lakkhī vata me udapādi ajja, ", "ja484:16.2": "Yo addasāsiṁ pavaraṁ dijānaṁ; ", "ja484:16.3": "Suvassa sutvāna subhāsitāni, ", "ja484:16.4": "Kāhāmi puññāni anappakāni”. ", "ja484:17.1": "So kosiyo attamano udaggo, ", "ja484:17.2": "Annañca pānañcabhisaṅkharitvā; ", "ja484:17.3": "Annena pānena pasannacitto, ", "ja484:17.4": "Santappayi samaṇabrāhmaṇe cāti. ", "ja484:18.1": "Sālikedārajātakaṁ paṭhamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja484:0.1": "", "ja484:0.2": "", "ja484:0.3": "", "ja484:0.4": "", "ja484:1.1": "", "ja484:1.2": "", "ja484:1.3": "", "ja484:1.4": "ne → naṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1); te (sya1ed, sya2ed); taṁ (Ma-aka) ", "ja484:2.1": "", "ja484:2.2": "nesaṁ → so tesaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja484:2.3": "", "ja484:2.4": "", "ja484:3.1": "Oḍḍentu → ujjhantu (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja484:3.2": "", "ja484:3.3": "", "ja484:3.4": "ānayehi → ānayetha (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja484:4.1": "bhutvā pivitvā ca → bhutvā ca pītvā ca (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja484:4.2": "", "ja484:4.3": "", "ja484:4.4": "", "ja484:5.1": "", "ja484:5.2": "", "ja484:5.3": "", "ja484:5.4": "", "ja484:6.1": "", "ja484:6.2": "", "ja484:6.3": "", "ja484:6.4": "nidāhasi → nidhīyasi (bj, pts-vp-pli1); nidheyyasi (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja484:7.1": "", "ja484:7.2": "", "ja484:7.3": "", "ja484:7.4": "", "ja484:7.5": "", "ja4